@Passage-Speaker Barbara Liskov
@Passage-Section Data Abstraction and CLU
@Passage-Text The work that I did in the 1970s, starting at around about 1973, was concerned with programming language support for a concept called data abstraction. This work was concerned with how to make programmers more productive, and how to help them produce programs that were more robust and easier to modify.
@Passage-Context Could you tell me something about the research you have done? Give me some sense of what projects you worked on, what were the problems?
@Passage-JevQuestion Does this passage describe the speaker's own contribution to computing?
